/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]options, and the gate documentation and skill-source updates.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Task triage gate identity, filer, and self-heal[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bead-gate[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bead-gate: rename the task triage sender to `bead`, shorten its note to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`<bead-id> — <title>`, route it to the `beads` panel, carry the bead's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]filer through `origin_agent` and the Markdown preview, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cancel-and-recreate pending gates that still use the previous [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]presentation contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Panel tabs and filer line in the notification modal[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]inbox[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]inbox: resolve notification modal tabs from the declared panel ahead of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the synthetic HITL and Errors tabs, order and label panel tabs, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render the filing agent on the detail pane's meta line.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Gate action panel title and filer line[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]action-panel[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]action-panel: title the generic gate review modal from its adapter [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]instead of the hardcoded \"Custom Gate\" string and render a \"Filed by\" [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]line above the Context section when the gate declares an origin agent.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold